when (start_clicked).
# Tanda 1: list mutation, for-each, functions with body, %, range/str/num, ==.
save [1, 2, 3] to xs.
add 4 to xs.
change item 1 of xs to 10.
remove item 2 of xs.
display xs.
define function sum(ys), save 0 to total, for each y in ys, save total + y to total, return total.
display sum(xs).
display sum(range(5)).
for each n in range(6), if (n % 2 == 0), display str(n) ++ " is even", else display str(n) ++ " is odd".
